AtlasJan <sonikong@gmail.com> writes:

> Which way do you think is best to play nethack?
> if it's the server, what server would you say is best?

It depends on your preferences, there are pros and cons for both running
it locally and on a server.

If you want to customize the game yourself and have sufficient knowhow,
you may prefer compiling the game yourself to run on your own machine,
and have the patches you choose. 

If you want to share bones and like your scores to be on the same
highscore list with other players, you may prefer using a server.
But of course, playing on a server needs the network connection, and
depending on the location of the server and whatever random network
problems, you may experience some network overhead between your move and
the screen update.

